          "text": "Aboobo mazyalani oonse kuzwida kuli-Abrahamu kusikila kuli-Davida akali mazyalani aali ikumi mwaane, akuzwida kuli-Davida akusikila kukulonzegwa ku-Babuloni mazyalani aya aalo ali ikumi mwaane, akuzwida kukulonzegwa ku-Babuloni akusikila kuli-Kristo mazyalani aya aalo ali ikumi mwaane.",
