        {
          "text": "Lino mbuboobu mbwaakazyalwa Jesu Kristo. Maliya banyina katangidwe kuli-Josefa, lino kabatana kuswanaana wakabonwa kuti ulimitide kuli-Muuya Uusalala. ",
          "type": "text",
