        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela naakali kuyeeya miyeeyo eyi kwakamubonekela angelo wa-Jehova muciloto, wakati, Josefa mwanaakwe Davida, utayoowi kulitambwida mwanakazi wako, nkaambo kakuti eco cimitidwe mulinguwe nca-Muuya Uusalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
